(S, "In 1999 General Pervez Musharraf replaced Nawaz Sharif and became what?", ["Chief Executive of Pakistan", "President of Pakistan", "Prime Minister", "Governor General"], 0, "After the coup of 12 October 1999 Musharraf took the title Chief Executive.", "He became President in June 2001.", [915]),
(S, "Which planet is nearest to the Earth?", ["Venus", "Mars", "Mercury", "Jupiter"], 0, "Venus comes closest to Earth, about 40 million km away at its nearest, and is the standard textbook answer.", "Some sources say Mercury is closest on average over time, so sources differ.", [191]),
